  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Wei Yang walks Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing through Shang clan city’s districts. At the substitute refinement zone he names the fear of a strong-willed wild Gu or a Gu an expert left behind, then says the higher the rank the harder the refine, and that Empress Wu Ji once spent eleven years just to refine a rank five dragon strength Gu, so substitute refinement stays a market necessity.",
        "chapters": [
          265
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_wei_yang",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "sys_wild_gu",
          "char_empress_wu_ji"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan recalls that ancient strength path used beast strength Gu such as green bull strength Gu, Biao strength Gu, and dragon strength Gu, and that ancient materials are already extremely rare, so refining cost is huge. He also notes that refining a dragon soul with dragon soul Gu would boost dragon strength Gu, dragon scales Gu, or dragon travel Gu later.",
        "chapters": [
          442
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ancient-beast-strength-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "path_strength",
          "gu_beast_strength_gu",
          "gu_strength_gu",
          "gu_biao_strength_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Against Wu Yong, he activates rank seven dragon strength Immortal Gu on dragon arms and claws while reverse flow protection seal holds. These Immortal Gu were all borrowed from Wu clan.",
        "chapters": [
          1391
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
